# Weights and images are distributed separately, see README.md. Result files
# (outputs/revision/*.json) and generated tables are tracked on purpose so every
# number in the paper can be traced to the file that produced it.
*.pth
*.pt
# The four correctors the revised paper reports are the exception. They are what
# every table describes, so a reader should be able to inspect them without
# fetching an archive.
!checkpointpaper/selected/*.pth
*.tif
*.tiff
__pycache__/
*.pyc
logs/
pku37_oct_dataset/PKU37_OCT_Denoising
duke_sota_datasets/Sparsity_SDOCT_DATASET_2012
duke_sota_datasets/Duke2013_SBSDI
revision/figures/*.png
revision/figures/*.pdf
